quran[8]{c,v,t}:
  13,35,"The depiction of Paradise, which the God-conscious have been promised, is rivers flowing beneath them, and its fruits everlasting as its shade. Such is the ultimate end of those who are God-conscious, while the ultimate end of the disbelievers is the Fire."
  13,36,"And those to whom We have given the Book are delighted at what has been revealed to you. And among their factions, some deny parts of it. Say: ‘Indeed I have been commanded to worship Allah only and not to associate (any) partner with Him. To Him do I invite, and to Him will be my return.’"
  13,37,"Thus, We have revealed it as a judgement in Arabic. And (O listener!) if you follow their desires after the knowledge has come to you, you shall have neither any guardian against Allah, nor any protector."
  13,38,"Indeed, We have sent messengers before you, and We gave them wives and children. And it is not for a messenger to bring a (miraculous) sign except with Allah’s permission. For every term, there is a Book."
  13,39,Allah erases whatever He wishes and confirms (whatever He wills). And with Him lies the Master Record.
  13,40,"And whether We show you some part of that (worldly punishment) which We have promised them (during your life), or We take you (to Our Presence before that), you only have to communicate (the message), and the reckoning is upon Us."
  13,41,"Have they not seen how We are moving forward into (their) territory, shrinking its borders? And Allah decides; there is none to repeal His decision, and He is swift at reckoning."
  13,42,"Those before them (also) schemed, but ultimate plans belong to Allah entirely. He knows what every soul will earn. But the disbelievers will soon know who has the Final Abode!"
